            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed in the present invention is an information method, comprising: a first terminal device sending information to a second electronic device; and the first terminal device starting a first timer, the first terminal device being a terminal device that performs terminal device-to-terminal device communication. A network device configures the first terminal device with a terminal device-to-terminal device connection condition. Further disclosed in the present invention are an electronic device, a network device and a storage medium.</p>
